flowchart TD
    A[Scryfall bulk metadata] --> B[Download source to temporary storage]
    B --> C[Verify size, content type, SHA-256]
    C --> D[Stream parse and normalize into staging]
    D --> E[Validate counts, identities, relationships, prices]
    E -- Failure --> F[Record failure; retain current catalog]
    E -- Success --> G[Promote staging transactionally]
    G --> H[Refresh PostgreSQL search indexes]
    G --> I[Generate deterministic SQLite snapshot]
    I --> J[SQLite integrity check + SHA-256]
    J --> K[Upload immutable artifact]
    K --> L[Publish manifest only after upload succeeds]
